      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-08T18:23:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Maybe put the name of the nominees first and not the nominators.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I don't think the nominators even need to put their names (as it's right there on the forums) - I just put \"Anonymous\" on those so folks didn't think I was nominating them. I'll make it a heading, instead.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Or were you thinking we should have names of the nominees before the awards? 'Cuz honestly, I don't think that matters much - as long as folks put the information in, we'll parse it out.</p>",
